83	     this Safelist, and so any HTML entities in the output will be appropriately escaped. If you want plain text, not
84	     HTML, you should use a text method such as {@link Element#text()} instead, after cleaning the document.
85	     </p>
86	     <p>Example:</p>
87	     <pre>{@code
88	     String sourceBodyHtml = "<p>5 is &lt; 6.</p>";
89	     String html = Jsoup.clean(sourceBodyHtml, Safelist.none());
90	
91	     Cleaner cleaner = new Cleaner(Safelist.none());
92	     String text = cleaner.clean(Jsoup.parse(sourceBodyHtml)).text();
