118	     This safelist allows a fuller range of text nodes: <code>a, b, blockquote, br, cite, code, dd, dl, dt, em, i, li,
119	     ol, p, pre, q, small, span, strike, strong, sub, sup, u, ul</code>, and appropriate attributes.
